==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*7 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Aoshi Shinomori (Enemy)|Aoshi Shinomori]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**10 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

